      "id": "one-piece-jolly-roger",
      "kind": "photo",
      "title": "Straw Hat Jolly Roger",
      "by": "Eiichiro Oda — One Piece",
      "year": 1997,
      "note": "One Piece marked how I want to live: pick a dream and build a crew of people who dream like you. The flag is the whole idea in one mark — a skull everyone recognizes, made yours by one small change (the hat). Black and white plus a single accent, readable at any size, flown from a wooden ship under a flat blue sky. A seal for a crew, the same job as the card back.",
